{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41597","headline":"僻居酬友人 · 伍乔","name":"僻居酬友人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"僻居虽爱近林泉，幽径闲居碧藓连。\n向竹掩扉随鹤息，就溪安石学僧禅。\n古琴带月音声亮，山果经霜气味全。\n多谢故交怜朴野，隔云时复寄佳篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"伍乔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41597.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41597","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}